  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi with water to soak.\n• Slice capsicum into thin strips.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf319/step-0db80d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine mild Caribbean jerk seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf319/step-75dceb10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Add capsicum and cook, until slightly softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add sweetcorn and cook until lightly charred, 4-5 minutes.\n• Transfer veggies to a bowl. Cover to keep warm. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf319/step-4c6b3420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm slices.\n• Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. TIP: The spice blend will char slightly in the pan, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf319/step-8b27c230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine the water (for the couscous) and vegetable stock in a medium saucepan. Bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and a drizzle of olive oil, stirring to combine. Cover with a lid, then remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork. Stir through baby spinach, corn and capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf319/step-3a89fe40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Divide veggie couscous between bowls. Top with haloumi.\n• Top with coconut sweet chilli mayo to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fa0d0527cba53bf319/step-84a2f250.jpg"
    }
  ]
